  "rationale": "We recommend escalating this claim for investigation because the claimant states that some of the claimed damages are due to pre-existing rust and cracking from age rather than the collision. Section [BASIC-2.1] governs direct and accidental loss caused by collision, and further review is needed to separate the collision damage from pre-existing deterioration.",
